silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_04_type_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_2#typedleg_record silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedLeg_record is TypedLeg_record is the olog-object VetRecord77 viewed as a leg in the Mittens colimit diagram D_Mittens. After type^Kl assigns the \"record\" sort, this leg is available to the glue step which will wire it into the cocone via lambda_rec: TypedLeg_record -> Mittens." .
